  "discussion": {
    "headline": "cool, breezy weekend to follow thursday's showers",
    "dateLine": "11:00 a.m. Wednesday, November 11, 2026",
    "excerpt": "The second week of November kicked off on a partly sunny, windy and seasonable note with northwesterly wind gusts up to 40 mph accompanying high temperatures around 60°F on Monday. However, west-southwesterly flow returned on Tuesday and ushered noticeably milder air back into northern MD and southeastern PA. High temperatures reached the mid-to-upper 60s Tuesday afternoon under mostly sunny skies, and we'll be treated to a \"repeat performance\" this afternoon (see below). …",
